// chunks) and Building Blocks (grammatical CONCEPTS). A Building Block is a concept with
// register realisations — 食べています / 食べてます / 食べてる are ONE mastery item, not three.
// Static curriculum here; learner progress lives in its own store (JA_GRAMMAR_KEY) so
// vocabulary belt totals and word scheduling can never be affected.
const JA_GRAMMAR_KEY = 'tt-ja-grammar-srs'
const JA_GRAMMAR_MIGRATION = 'ja-grammar-curriculum-v1'
// realisations: { polite, politeCasual, natural } — surface only, never separate mastery.
