    // reported as ONE span when any of them is an accidental fragment (no dictionary entry):
    // วิท+ยา+ศาสต → วิทยาศาสต(ร์), ผัก|บุ้ง → the blocked span, not a meaningless syllable. A merged
    // report feeds the recovery prompt the real word to avoid. Blocking itself is unchanged.
