// v669 §10 — OBJECTIVE cue FORM alignment. A cue may not turn the Thai question into a statement (or a statement into a
// question). Only unambiguous evidence counts: the Thai ends in a question particle AND the English is a question (or neither);
// the cue explicitly says "says / tells …" or "asks …". Everything subtler stays with the cue judge.
const THAI_Q_END_RE = /(ไหม|มั้ย|หรือเปล่า|หรือยัง|เหรอ|หรอ|ใช่ไหม|ไม่ใช่เหรอ)(ครับ|คะ|ค่ะ|นะ|จ๊ะ|จ้ะ|ล่ะ)*\s*[?？]?$/
