  'A and B pick a time and a place to meet': ['time|today|tomorrow|when|am|pm|o\'clock', 'meet|see|go'],
  'A and B tidy the kitchen: short requests and replies': ['clean|wash|tidy|put|keep', 'kitchen|room|home'],
  'A asks how much something is; B says the price; they agree': ['how much|price|cost|baht|money'],
  'A and B meet and say who they are': [],
