// ══ v659 — LISTENING GENERATOR (one shared component for TH / JA / ZH) ═══════════════════════════════════
// The Listening Track is generated on the SAME generator shell as Daily / Revision: header, progress bar, chips,
// status line, Generation log (⬇ log / ▲ History), cost, the 30 selected word tiles, attempt History. The only
// pedagogical difference is the denominator: 30 TARGET COVERAGE slots (≥1 verified occurrence each) instead of
