// ══ LEXICAL BOUNDARY (thai-lexicon-metadata-v1) ═══════════════════════════════
// LEARNER STATE lives in saved vocabulary (status, SRS, exposure, belt progress).
// LEXICAL METADATA (Thai, meaning, sense, usage, register, phonetic) lives in the
// canonical bank. A selected target keeps its learner state and takes its lexical
// metadata from the canonical record with the SAME stable id. Shared pieces are
// language-agnostic; Thai is wired now, Japanese/Mandarin can adopt the same shape.
